ep 7: Report\n\n**Refactoring Complete:**\n- **Refactoring:** Extracted the survival/birth rules into a named, documented `isAliveNextGeneration` predicate; removed the redundant `alive` binding.\n- **Mass Change:** Rule logic relocated (transition block ~38 → ~29; net conserved via the new 12-mass predicate). Traded flat mass for a decisive **intent-clarity** gain (Rule 2 > APP).\n- **Tests:** All 9 passing."}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_05-59-26_game-of-life-example-mapping_v6.2.1-phase-continuation-pi_opus-4-8/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/game-of-life.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/game-of-life.ts\nPassing tests: 9 (all tests complete)\nRecent changes: All rules and pattern examples (blinker, block) now covered and passing.\n\nDo a final refactor pass over the complete implementation while keeping all 9 tests green. Run tests with `pnpm test`.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/game-of-life.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/game-of-life.ts\nPassing tests: 9 (all tests complete)\nRecent changes: All rules and pattern examples (blinker, block) now covered and passing.\n\nDo a final refactor pass over the complete implementation while keeping all 9 tests green. Run tests with `pnpm test`.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784959453647},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll start by reading the current implementation and tests."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01JMw8HfMx5CZinRhsXUahB7","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_05-59-26_game-of-life-example-mapping_v6.2.1-phase-continuation-pi_opus-4-8/src/game-of-life.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01MW6nyhvdRRhLudDRh3XPub","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/experiment